## Why this choice, recorded

PLAN §10 asked for either a licence that covers the whole set or per-component
notices. No single licence does: the set spans GPL-2.0-only, GPL-3.0-or-later,
MIT, proprietary terms, and one component with no declared licence at all.
Per-component notices are therefore the only honest option, and the unlicensed
`theme.json` is called out on its own line rather than being quietly folded
under a neighbour's terms.
